},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001","text":"仲德兄孫文和，景和中，為征北義陽王昶府佐。昶于彭城奔魏，部曲皆散，文和獨送至界上。昶謂曰：「諸人皆去，卿有老母，何獨不去？」文和乃去。升明中，為巴陵內史。沈攸之事起，文和斬其使，馳白齊武帝。及齊永明年中，曆青、冀、兗、益四州刺史。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"仲德","kind":"person","person_id":"qsd_v11_ya1_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"文和","kind":"person","person_id":"726_jlm_j1k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"昶","kind":"person","person_id":"g9z_y41_l95","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"昶","kind":"person","person_id":"g9z_y41_l95","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"文和","kind":"person","person_id":"726_jlm_j1k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"昶","kind":"person","person_id":"g9z_y41_l95","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:u0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"老母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"王文和母，由義陽王對文和說「卿有老母」知，未載姓名。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"文和","kind":"person","person_id":"726_jlm_j1k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0077","start":77,"end":80,"surface":"沈攸之","kind":"person","person_id":"16c_0og_lvl_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:m0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"文和","kind":"person","person_id":"726_jlm_j1k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe:p001:u0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"使","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"沈攸之所遣使者，姓名未見。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":27,"last_line":27,"revision_id":12757141,"raw_start":1378,"raw_end":1493,"raw_character_offsets":[1378,1379,1380,1381,1382,1383,1384,1385,1386,1387,1388,1389,1390,1391,1392,1393,1394,1395,1396,1397,1398,1399,1400,1401,1402,1403,1404,1405,1406,1407,1408,1409,1410,1411,1412,1413,1414,1415,1416,1417,1418,1419,1420,1421,1422,1423,1424,1425,1426,1427,1428,1429,1430,1431,1432,1433,1434,1435,1436,1437,1438,1439,1440,1441,1442,1443,1444,1445,1446,1447,1448,1449,1450,1451,1452,1453,1454,1455,1456,1457,1458,1459,1460,1461,1462,1463,1464,1465,1466,1467,1468,1469,1470,1471,1472,1473,1474,1475,1476,1477,1478,1479,1480,1481,1482,1483,1484,1485,1486,1487,1488,1489,1490,1491,1492]},"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-025-wangwenhe","book_id":"b-nanshi-025","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-025-wangwenhe-ws12757141"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p004","text":"后父偃，字子游，晉丞相導玄孫，尚書嘏之子也。母晉孝武帝女鄱陽公主，宋受禪，封永成君。偃尚高祖第二女吳興長公主諱榮男，少歷顯官，黃門侍郎，祕書監，侍中。元嘉末，為散騎常侍、右衞將軍。世祖即位，以后父，授金紫光祿大夫，領義陽王師，常侍如故。遷右光祿大夫，常侍、王師如故。偃謙虛恭謹，不以世事關懷。孝建二年卒，時年五十四。追贈開府儀同三司，本官如故，諡曰恭公。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":2,"end":3,"surface":"偃","id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p004:m0002","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作偃。"},{"start":5,"end":7,"surface":"子游","id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p004:m0005","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作偃。"},{"start":11,"end":12,"surface":"導","id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p004:m0011","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作導。"},{"start":17,"end":18,"surface":"嘏","id":"c-songshu-041-wangxianyuan-family:p004:m0017","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAACAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作嘏。"},{"start":42,"end":43,"sur